{"ref":"BDB, מוֹטָה","hw":"מוֹטָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹטָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. pole, bar</strong> of yoke, mostly late (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, מוֹט²\" href=\"/BDB,_מוֹט²\", dir=\"rtl\">מוֹט</a>);—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.10\">Je 28:10</a> + 4 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹטוֹת</span> etc., abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.2\">Je 27:2</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.15\">1 Ch 15:15</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.18\">Ez 30:18</a> + 4 times;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>pole</em>, pl., staves, for bearing ark <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 15:15\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.15.15\">1 Ch 15:15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>bar</em> of yoke, symb., of oppression <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.2\">Je 27:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹסֵרוֹת</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֹל²\" href=\"/BDB,_עֹל²\", dir=\"rtl\">עֹל</a> v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 27:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.27.12\">12</a>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.10\">28:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.12\">12</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֹל²\" href=\"/BDB,_עֹל²\", dir=\"rtl\">עֹל</a> v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.11\">11</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ עֵץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.13\">28:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳ בַּרְזֶל</span> v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:13\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.13\">13</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֹל²\" href=\"/BDB,_עֹל²\", dir=\"rtl\">עֹל</a> v <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 28:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.28.14\">14</a>); fig. of oppression, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.6\">Is 58:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.9\">9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.18\">Ez 30:18</a>; cf. (thongs of yoke) <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגֻדּוֹת מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.6\">Is 58:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹטֹת עֻלְּכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 26:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.26.13\">Lv 26:13</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.27\">Ez 34:27</a>.—On form of yoke v. Schumacher<sup>ZPV xii. 1889, 160</sup>, Benz<sup>Arch. 207</sup>.","next":"BDB, מוּךְ","prev":"BDB, מוֹט²"}